OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fevening with bright then clear spells
OL,7,Fand only the odd light shower.
OL,8,FOutbreaks of rain will spread north to
OL,9,FOrkney overnight, just reaching
OL,10,FShetland by morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FOccasionally heavy rain
OL,13,Fspreads north through the day, turning
OL,14,Fmore showery later. Strong southerly
OL,15,Fwinds developing, chance of coastal
OL,16,Fgales later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
